上带着金色的环状戒指。\n构图:女孩在左，，狗狗在右，辅助元素：台灯，地板，篮球，\n### 输出要求\n1. 最终输出需整理成一条单行紧凑的自然语言描述的文生图提示词，生成中文提示词。\n", "Qwen2.5-VL-3B-Instruct", "none", false, 0.7, 512, 1026, "randomize", ""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 1544, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "video_path"}, "shape": 7, "name": "video_path", "label": "video_path", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "video_path"}], "flags": {}, "id": 213, "type": "Qwen2.5VL", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Qwen2.5VL"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [1566], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [458.97186279296875, 59.61949157714844], "widgets_values": ["写实摄影风格，第一人称视角，黄昏时分的城市天际线背景下，一位身穿黑色皮质紧身连体衣的女性站在高楼边缘，连体衣带有金属拉链、肩部链条装饰和金色腰带扣，搭配黑色高跟鞋与半指手套，佩戴黑色口罩遮住下半脸，露出深邃眼神与长发披肩，颈部佩戴简约项链，背景为落日余晖洒在城市建筑群上，暖色调天空与冷色城市灯光交织，主光源来自画面左侧地平线上的夕阳，营造出神秘而酷炫的氛围，整体构图突出人物主体，展现都市夜行者般的冷艳气质。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "link": 1545, "label": "value", "type": "STRING"